 # Clonedeps Skill
 
 You help users make a small set of important dependency source repositories
-locally readable to OpenCode.
+locally readable to the agent.
 
 This is a workflow skill, not a command wrapper. Do not use a helper script for
 dependency detection, ref validation, cloning, status, or cleanup. The
 orchestrator and `@explorer` do the repo-specific thinking; the orchestrator
 performs the approved filesystem/git operations directly.
 
+This skill runs in OpenCode, Claude Code, and Codex. "The orchestrator" is the
+main agent. `@explorer` is a read-only exploration subagent: the `Explore` agent
+in Claude Code, `explorer` in Codex and OpenCode. When the tool has none, or the
+user did not allow subagents, the orchestrator does that reading itself with the
+same prompt.
+
